Typesense on FenrirOS
=====================

Typesense is a fast, typo-tolerant search engine for instant search (an alternative to Algolia),
with vector and semantic search. Nothing is enabled or configured:

  /etc/typesense/typesense-server.ini   the configuration: api-key is NOT set, Typesense will not start
                                        without one (generate it, put it there; it is the admin credential)
  /etc/dinit.d/typesense                the service (dinitctl enable typesense): _typesense user, 127.0.0.1:8108
  /var/lib/typesense                    the data

Typesense is built here against the system ONNX Runtime for its embedding models (text and image
embeddings are downloaded by Typesense itself when a collection asks for a model; that needs a
network at run time).
